item-traceability-v1","title":"特性与道具先查询，再核对计算回读","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"特性 道具 ability item 查询 资源 机制 回读 标识","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-23","sourceUrl":"https://pokeapi.co/docs/v2","content":"项目可通过lookupPokemonResource查询ability与item资源，也可查询move和nature。资料接口返回的是允许字段中的可用内容，并附来源和本地参考身份。没有返回某项机制说明时，应明确资料不足，不要仅凭名字猜测其效果。成员特性候选与当前保存特性也需分开：候选只说明资料列出这个名称，不代表用户已经选择它。\n\n本地计算桥接会验证非空的特性与道具名称，无法识别时拒绝计算。计算完成后应核对assumptions中实际使用的名称；缺省或未填写的配置不能被解读为某个道具已生效。队伍存储只验证名称输入边界，不提供特性、道具和物种的完整搭配合法性审查。推荐某个组合之前，还需要规则与机制支持，不能由保存成功推出组合合法或最优。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[{"title":"PokéAPI v2资源字段文档","publisher":"PokéAPI","url":"https://pokeapi.co/docs/v2","checkedAt":"2026-10-23","relation":"API_FIELD_REFERENCE"},{"title":"Smogon damage-calc项目接口说明","publisher":"Smogon damage-calc contributors","url":"https://github.com/smogon/damage-calc","checkedAt":"2026-10-23","relation":"ENGINE_INTERFACE_REFERENCE"}],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/reference/LocalPokeApiRepository.java","sha256":"fd086f665294efba73948c47d216865d3cdf35bc42cd311c2a1648e2c8842475"},{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/domain/TeamBuild.java","sha256":"03e80f52f6a583f8c00d5e60febc16763f9d2983d57462b2235c5237219d36e2"},{"path":"tools/pokemon-engine/calculate.cjs","sha256":"90e080660f1f4f65062358728d8448143a16e82adc148bcabc014af4512f3358"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["resource"]}},"score":3088,"checksum":"sha256:3c8d70531f85fa933fbb2b3e7d0c7c1308e3c422aa1907e8ad1ab5bd9435946c","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-d27e56e88f9d1e9ab37edbd12e15e843217300573b42006cf0daa47b4be5bca9","documentVersion":"sha256:95ee64bb91153af9b31cbe76fabcdaaf3523bc072996a7b2314c082ba77ad2a8","chunkNo":1,"startOffset":167,"endOffset":321,"text":"本地计算桥接会验证非空的特性与道具名称，无法识别时拒绝计算。计算完成后应核对assumptions中实际使用的名称；缺省或未填写的配置不能被解读为某个道具已生效。队伍存储只验证名称输入边界，不提供特性、道具和物种的完整搭配合法性审查。推荐某个组合之前，还需要规则与机制支持，不能由保存成功推出组合合法或最优。","contentHash":"sha256:453e4b71c393435ff20cf137a081385ccd7d886c51785d1d987cbc3bca87f847"}}]]], messageType=TOOL, metadata={messageType=TOOL}}, UserMessage{content='Based on user needs, proactively select the most appropriate tool or combination of tools.
For complex tasks, you can break down the problem and use different tools step by step to solve it.
After using each tool, clearly explain the execution results and suggest the next steps.

Guidelines:
1. If the user's request is simple and you can answer directly, just respond without using tools.
2. For multi-step tasks, plan the sequence before acting — search first, then analyze, then generate.
3. After each tool execution, review the result. If something went wrong, try an alternative approach.
4. When a task requires information from multiple sources, gather all data before synthesizing.
5. Once you have enough evidence, respond with the final answer directly, without any tool call.
   A direct answer ends the task automatically. Do not spend another turn calling doTerminate.
   If evidence is unavailable, explain the limitation and answer only what can be supported.

Remember: You are in control. Drive the task forward step by step until it is done.
